				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-8456779/scp-125-de#post-4052505</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 07 Nov 2018 16:11:16 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Melissanoma</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3260593</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I really like the imagery of the giant king, resting his head on the table and sleepily talking with visitors.</p> <p>Also, a minor pet peeve of mine is when initial interviews with sapient anomalies have the interviewer refer to them with their number designation without warning, so it was nice seeing the king call him out on the weirdness of &quot;Eszepeonetwofivedeeh&quot;/&quot;Ezehpeheinszwofünfdeeh&quot; as a name.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
